---Information about the election that was queried.
---@class gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElection
---@field type? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionTypeEnum How are voters assigned to jurisdictions in this election Not exposed publicly as it is irrelevant given that we have version separation
---@field earlyVoteEndDate? string Early vote start date in YYYY-MM-DD format. This field is only populated if there is a consistent end date for all regions covered by this election.
---@field defaultLanguage? string What is the default language for responses for this election
---@field voterInfoAllowlist? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaResponseAllowlist If specified, restrict results according to the allowlist criteria
---@field shapeLookupBehavior? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionShapeLookupBehaviorEnum
---@field absenteeBallotDeadline? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaDeadlineList Absentee ballot deadline. Only populated if there is a consistent deadline for all regions covered by this election.
---@field ocdDivisionId? string The political division of the election. Represented as an OCD Division ID. Voters within these political jurisdictions are covered by this election. This is typically a state such as ocd-division/country:us/state:ca or for the midterms or general election the entire US (i.e. ocd-division/country:us).
---@field voterRegistrationDeadline? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaDeadlineList Voter registration deadline. Only populated if there is a consistent deadline for all regions covered by this election.
---@field electionDay? string Day of the election in YYYY-MM-DD format.
---@field apiProxyUrlBase? string If we have a proxy election, what is the URL
---@field lastUpdated? string Last updated
---@field name? string
---@field voterInfoStatus? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionVoterInfoStatusEnum What is the status of the voter information for this election.
---@field allowedReferer? gcp.civicinfo_v2.StringList If set, restrict the referers to these allowed URLs.
---@field redundantEvDatesStates? gcp.civicinfo_v2.StringList A list of states whose free-form early voting hours are known to fully specify their early vote dates, making the dates redundant to render in the UI.
---@field apiProxyQpsLimit? number The qps limit to send to the API. If qps to the API exceeds this amount send a 503. This provides the Big Red Button. Just set to 0 to stop proxying.
---@field earlyVoteStartDate? string Early vote start date in YYYY-MM-DD format. This field is only populated if there is a consistent start date for all regions covered by this election.
---@field dataSourceType? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionDataSourceTypeEnum How is the election specified
---@field id? string
---@field voterInfoAllowlistAfterDatafeedApplication? gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaResponseAllowlist Should not be specified in config. This is a modified version of voter_info_allowlist, computed by the API server at serving time, which results from intersecting voter_info_allowlist with the publish_types fields from datafeed.txt. That new allowlist is what gets enforced.

---@alias gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionDataSourceTypeEnum "electionsFeed"|"static"|"apiProxy"

---@alias gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElectionList gcp.civicinfo_v2.CivicinfoSchemaElection[]

